+<h2>11. Scenarios — Check Your Understanding</h2>
+
+<div class="scenario">
+  <div class="scenario-q">Scenario A: It's tomorrow night. You're on <code>feature/issue-40</code>, about to merge <code>origin/master</code>, and you suspect PROGRESS.md will conflict again. Without touching the working tree, how do you (1) confirm the conflict, (2) see what each side did to the file, and (3) decide keep-one vs keep-both before running the merge?</div>
