+git log --oneline $B..HEAD          -- Silmulator/docs/learning/PROGRESS.md
+git log --oneline $B..origin/master -- Silmulator/docs/learning/PROGRESS.md
+                              # (2) which commits on each side touched the log
+git diff $B HEAD          -- Silmulator/docs/learning/PROGRESS.md
+git diff $B origin/master -- Silmulator/docs/learning/PROGRESS.md
+                              # (3) read both sides' changes against the base</pre>
