+  <h1>Three-Way Merge Semantics — Vocabulary</h1>
+  <p class="tagline">Eight terms behind tonight's two PROGRESS.md collisions — one loud, one silent. Each has a definition, a project example from the real merge history, a usage sentence, and a contrast with the term it's most often confused with.</p>
